math","value":"P _ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 振动频率f= 5Hz，其产生的简谐横波在 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0.25 s"},{"type":"text","value":" 时沿水面某一传播方向的图像如图丙所示，已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"P_{1} , P_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 均在t=0时刻开始振动，则下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b6afe78b61cc8432925f50e0d31adb9a5da45dc70aab9f3449b91b5eef4eec78.png","width":325,"height":306,"width_mm":38.093,"row_group":"ningbo-shixiao-2503-q12-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/65b878ea63703e124643eadc648a268eeb6d46935075ec35562c54870d4c7a1e.png","width":428,"height":266,"width_mm":50.238,"row_group":"ningbo-shixiao-2503-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 12 题图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/302d46030b33e1936a512639bf3edc1060f6e4844b2c8ed792b85e12deaf9f04.png","width":426,"height":225,"width_mm":50.054,"row_group":"ningbo-shixiao-2503-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丙\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关公式或参数:重力加速度g均取10m/s²。\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 波源 "},{"type":"math","value":"P _ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 的起振方向沿y轴正方向"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 质点S为振动减弱点"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. t=1s 时质点S 向y轴负方向运动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 若以 "},{"type":"math","value":"P _ { 1 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 为圆心， "},{"type":"math","value":"P _ { 1 } S"},{"type":"text","value":" 为半径画一个圆，在该圆上有14个振动减弱点"}]],"answer":{"status":"not_ingested","key":null,"body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--ningbo-shixiao-2503-q13","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--ningbo-shixiao-2503","source_question_id":"ningbo-shixiao-2503-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"not_ingested","fingerprint":"f4d54c6d9526847c06010d2ef1c0097dc2dd3a2a37678d033fa2741daf05a895","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 1879年，霍尔（EdwinHall）做了一个经典的实验，他让电流I沿着y方向通过一个两维金属薄片（即薄片在z方向的厚度h相比y方向长度l和x方向的宽度d很小），然后在z方向加上个磁感应强度为B的匀强磁场，如图所示。霍尔发现，在薄片的x方向出现了电势差 "},{"type":"math","value":"U _ { \\mathrm { H } }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，后世把这个实验现象称为经典霍尔效应。这个实验的不寻常之处在于电压和电流不在一个方向上，因此意味着出现了一种新的横向电阻，它把y方向的电流和x方向的压降 "},{"type":"math","value":"U _ { \\mathrm { H } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 联系起来，该电阻也被称为霍尔电阻，定义为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R _ { \\mathrm { H } } { = } { \\frac { U _ { _ { H } } } { I } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 。在室温和磁感应强度不大且I不变的情况下，下列说法正确的旦\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5cb689658a9902842684a9906366138ae61babf6a3cb0018b330ad7e7af7f3a3.png","width":441,"height":220,"width_mm":51.71,"row_group":"ningbo-shixiao-2503-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关公式或参数:重力加速度g均取10m/s²。\n第 13 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. x方向上标号为4这侧的电势高于3这侧"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"R _ { \\mathrm { H } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 h成正比"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"R _ { \\mathrm { H } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 与B成正比"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"R _ { \\mathrm { H } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 与d成反比"}]],"answer":{"status":"not_ingested","key":null,"body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--ningbo-shixiao-2503-q14","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--ningbo-shixiao-2503","source_question_id":"ningbo-shixiao-2503-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"not_ingested","fingerprint":"5d3345fa710c79e21621bc136640e036ebf7997cec1950f546bdf649e596839b","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题（Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅲ三题共14分）\n\n14-Ⅰ.（5分）两研究小组分别用图甲和图乙装置探究“物体质量一定时，加速度与力的关系”。装置甲中各器材如图所示，装置乙中含有：带有遮光条的小车、容器（内有一压力传感器，可测小钢球对容器后侧壁的压力）、光电门、一端带有定滑轮的木板、重物、直径略小于容器宽度的小钢球（忽略小球和容器之间的摩擦力）、细线。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/583398dfa62b1e02e792e7a4cdf954bce7ed3648cf24ba8629538d310b915e06.png","width":502,"height":182,"width_mm":58.887,"row_group":"ningbo-shixiao-2503-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/07341e5e7b9661ab3674a45fc97d2b50abd93a0a20e612f30c01de472b63f61c.png","width":441,"height":268,"width_mm":51.71,"row_group":"ningbo-shixiao-2503-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a77c7dfb732d3